§§ `ss 73-76 -- the Court stopping the class action`

`no ground` MEANS `none`
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` TRUE FALSE FALSE `no ground` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE TRUE TRUE `no ground` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 74 needs money relief as well as the Court's conclusion.
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE TRUE `no ground` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE TRUE FALSE `no ground` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `(a) the costs as a class action are likely to exceed the costs of separate proceedings` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `(b) all the relief can be obtained by proceedings other than representative proceedings` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `(c) it will not be an efficient and effective means of dealing with the claims` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `(d) the representative party cannot adequately represent the group members` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `(e) it is otherwise inappropriate to pursue the claims as a class action` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `(d) the representative party cannot adequately represent the group members` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `only that the group does not include everyone who might have been included, or is aggregated for a purpose such as litigation funding` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the class action be stopped` FALSE FALSE FALSE `no ground` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

#ASSERT `What happens to my claim if the class action is stopped` `the representative party` TRUE EQUALS `I may continue the proceeding on my own behalf against the defendant (s 76(1)(a))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my claim if the class action is stopped` `a group member (not the representative party)` TRUE EQUALS `I may apply to be joined as a plaintiff, and the Court may order it (s 76(1)(b))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my claim if the class action is stopped` `a group member (not the representative party)` FALSE EQUALS `no such order has been made`
#ASSERT `What happens to my claim if the class action is stopped` `the representative party` FALSE EQUALS `no such order has been made`

