#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs` `member` `costs connected with a sub-group under s 77` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs` `the representative party` `any other costs of the proceeding` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs` `the representative party` `costs of a question that relates only to my claim, where the Court permitted me to appear for it (s 78)` EQUALS NOTHING

