§§ `s 89(3) -- appealing for the group`

-- Judgment 1 July 2027; the representative party's time ends 29 July 2027; the further 21 days run 30 July to 19 August.
#ASSERT `Last day for my appeal for the group` (`d` 29 7 2027) EQUALS `d` 19 8 2027
#ASSERT `Last day for my appeal for the group` (`d` 31 12 2027) EQUALS `d` 21 1 2028
#ASSERT `Last day for my appeal for the group` (`d` 15 2 2028) EQUALS `d` 7 3 2028

#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 10 8 2027) EQUALS `s 89(3) does not arise: the representative party appealed in time`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) FALSE TRUE (`d` 29 7 2027) (`d` 10 8 2027) EQUALS `not yet: the representative party's own time has not run out`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) FALSE TRUE (`d` 30 7 2027) (`d` 10 8 2027) EQUALS `in time: within the further 21 days (s 89(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) FALSE TRUE (`d` 19 8 2027) (`d` 25 8 2027) EQUALS `in time: within the further 21 days (s 89(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) FALSE TRUE (`d` 20 8 2027) (`d` 25 8 2027) EQUALS `out of time under s 89(3)`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 20 7 2027) EQUALS `not yet: the representative party's own time has not run out`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 19 8 2027) EQUALS `still open: I can appeal for the group within the further 21 days (s 89(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal for the group in time` (`d` 1 7 2027) (`d` 29 7 2027) FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 20 8 2027) EQUALS `out of time under s 89(3)`

§§ `s 89B -- limitation periods`

-- Class action commenced 1 March 2027 in the Supreme Court; the member's own limitation period would end 1 June 2027,
-- so 92 days were left when it began.
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `it is still running` EQUALS `suspended while the class action runs (s 89B(1))`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `I opted out under s 71` EQUALS `running again (s 89B(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `the proceeding was discontinued` EQUALS `running again (s 89B(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `the proceeding and any appeals were determined without finally disposing of my claim` EQUALS `running again (s 89B(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `the proceeding and any appeals finally disposed of my claim` EQUALS `no longer matters: my claim has been finally disposed of`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `the Court ordered that it no longer continue as a class action (ss 73-76)` EQUALS `the Act does not say: an order that the proceeding no longer continue as a class action is not one of the s 89B(2) events`
-- Already barred: last day 28 February 2027, the day before the class action began. Last day 1 March 2027: not barred.
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 28 2 2027) `it is still running` EQUALS `not suspended: my claim was already out of time when the class action began (s 89B(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) `it is still running` EQUALS `suspended while the class action runs (s 89B(1))`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `civil` (`d` 8 9 2019) (`d` 1 6 2020) `it is still running` EQUALS `Part VII does not govern this proceeding`
#ASSERT `Is my limitation period running` `a proceeding in another court` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `it is still running` EQUALS `Part VII does not govern this proceeding`

-- Opted out 10 October 2027: 92 days later is 10 January 2028. Discontinued 1 February 2028: 92 days later, across
-- 29 February 2028, is 3 May 2028. Last day on the day the class action began: 0 days left, so the day it runs again.
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `I opted out under s 71` (`d` 10 10 2027) EQUALS JUST (`d` 10 1 2028)
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `the proceeding was discontinued` (`d` 1 2 2028) EQUALS JUST (`d` 3 5 2028)
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 3 2027) `the proceeding and any appeals were determined without finally disposing of my claim` (`d` 5 5 2028) EQUALS JUST (`d` 5 5 2028)
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 28 2 2027) `I opted out under s 71` (`d` 10 10 2027) EQUALS JUST (`d` 28 2 2027)
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `it is still running` (`d` 10 10 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `the Court ordered that it no longer continue as a class action (ss 73-76)` (`d` 10 10 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 1 6 2027) `the proceeding and any appeals finally disposed of my claim` (`d` 10 10 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `By when must I start my own proceeding` `civil` (`d` 8 9 2019) (`d` 1 6 2020) `I opted out under s 71` (`d` 10 10 2019) EQUALS NOTHING
